aude-service CE row whose usage type does not map to a known token metric, asserting the row is dropped/skipped rather than mispriced and that _rate_for falls back as designed.","cohort":["E3","E5","F4","G5","T5b","T6","T9","necessity","project.failure-disposition-contract","project.portability"],"criteria":["E5"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.5375,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'For Marketplace usage type `USE1-MP:USE1_InputTokenCount-Units`, derive region `USE1`, map `InputTokenCount` to existing suffix `input-tokens`'","ACs cover only the happy-path mappings (InputTokenCount, OutputTokenCount, cache-read/write) and the legacy row; no AC exercises an unrecognized/malformed marketplace usage type.","Raised-bar note: this is a new parsing behavior with a non-happy path (unrecognized format) that is not covered."],"finding":"The bridge parses fixed string formats (service label suffix ' (Amazon Bedrock Edition)', usage type 'USE1-MP:USE1_InputTokenCount-Units' into region+metric), but no acceptance criterion or test covers a Claude-service CE row whose usage type does NOT parse into a recognized token metric (unexpected metric name, missing region prefix, or a service in the allowlist that returns an unmodeled usage type). Without a test for the unparseable/unrecognized case, a format drift could silently drop pricing rows and regress the cap toward the very synthetic-number failure this ticket fixes.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fb4bb136291dfb439","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Required bridge; Acceptance Criteria","norm_id":"nf0eaa8fd12bd1e26","priority":0.4125,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"underspecified_certification","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Verify (against a live Cost Explorer bill or AWS docs) the exact SERVICE dimension strings for each Claude Marketplace service and the Marketplace USAGE_TYPE format ('USE1-MP:USE1_InputTokenCount-Units'), and state how a mismatch is detected rather than silently excluded (e.g. an assertion/log when the allowlist yields zero Claude rows).","cohort":["T3"],"criteria":["T3"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.9,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan hardcodes SERVICE Values: 'Claude Sonnet 4.5 (Amazon Bedrock Edition)', 'Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Amazon Bedrock Edition)', 'Claude Haiku 4.5 (Amazon Bedrock Edition)', 'Claude Opus 4.7 (Amazon Bedrock Edition)'","Plan asserts Marketplace usage type 'USE1-MP:USE1_InputTokenCount-Units' with region-strip and *-Units per-1000 conversion","These are external-service billing facts unknowable from plan text or repo; some named versions (Sonnet 4.6, Opus 4.7) appear forward-looking/unreleased so their billed SERVICE strings cannot be confirmed","Evidence class: Unverified (could not probe live CE billing dimension strings)"],"finding":"The exact AWS Cost Explorer SERVICE dimension strings and the Marketplace USAGE_TYPE token format that the whole filter+bridge depends on are asserted but unverified against a live bill or CE docs.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f218d515294c3c2b1","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Required filter change / Required bridge sections","norm_id":"n8363b1f6f2907b8c","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["AWS bills Claude Marketplace under a SERVICE string that differs by even one character (e.g. 'Anthropic Claude ...' or a different capitalization) from the hardcoded allowlist","A model version in the list is not yet available, so its SERVICE string does not exist and the filter contributes nothing"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.9,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"high","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State the general Marketplace usage-type parse rule (region = prefix before `-MP:`, metric = token between the region underscore and `-Units`) and the fallback behavior for unrecognized shapes.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5d","T5e"],"criteria":["E2"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.468,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["'For Marketplace usage type USE1-MP:USE1_InputTokenCount-Units, derive region USE1, map InputTokenCount to existing suffix input-tokens'","No general rule stated for parsing region prefix or for other regions/usage-type shapes"],"finding":"Region/metric extraction from Marketplace usage types is given only as a single worked example ('USE1-MP:USE1_InputTokenCount-Units' -> region USE1). The general parse rule (how to extract region and metric token from an arbitrary `<REGION>-MP:<REGION>_<Metric>-Units` string, and behavior for non-USE1 regions) is not stated as a decision.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f5e99f12436ec944e","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Required bridge section","norm_id":"n8a8fada40aacfc57","priority":0.132,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A euw1/apne1 Marketplace usage row, or a usage type with an unexpected shape, is encountered and the executor must guess the parse rule"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add: 'Parse `<REGION>-MP:<REGION>_<Metric>-Units`; region is the token before `-MP:`, metric is the segment between `<REGION>_` and `-Units`. Unrecognized shapes are skipped (fail-closed).'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State how BEDROCK_SERVICE_VALUES stays complete as Claude Bedrock Edition models are added/renamed (and note the silent-exclusion risk), or justify why a static four-name allowlist is acceptable versus a discovery-based approach (e.g. enumerate SERVICE dimension values matching an '(Amazon Bedrock Edition)' pattern before pricing).","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.6,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["Plan lists exactly: 'Amazon Bedrock', 'Claude Sonnet 4.5 ...', 'Claude Sonnet 4.6 ...', 'Claude Haiku 4.5 ...', 'Claude Opus 4.7 (Amazon Bedrock Edition)'","CE get_cost_and_usage Filter Values requires exact service-string matches; a model billed under a service name absent from the list yields no CE rows and is silently dropped from both _refresh_rates() and _ce_spend_today()","Problem statement: cap 'falls back silently, so both thresholds fire on a synthetic number' -- the same class of failure recurs for any model outside the static list"],"finding":"The chosen mechanism uses a hardcoded exact-string SERVICE allowlist (four enumerated Claude Marketplace service names). AWS Cost Explorer's SERVICE dimension Values filter matches exactly, so any Claude Bedrock Edition model whose service string is not in BEDROCK_SERVICE_VALUES is silently excluded from both CE reads -- reintroducing the exact silent-fallback-to-synthetic-number failure this ticket exists to fix, but for out-of-list models. The plan does not acknowledge this maintenance brittleness nor weigh a discovery-based alternative.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f19091ccc7f17422b","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Required filter change / BEDROCK_SERVICE_VALUES","norm_id":"nf0a007ba2aa8fe07","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled"